OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy but
OL,6,Fdry initially overnight with an
OL,7,Fincreasing southeasterly wind. Spells
OL,8,Fof rain, hill snow, and perhaps
OL,9,Ffreezing rain, gradually move east
OL,10,Facross the region from midnight. Wind
OL,11,Flight but very breezy along the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA chilly and dull day with
OL,14,Fstrong winds and occasional rain that
OL,15,Fmay initially fall as snow or freezing
OL,16,Frain over the hills. Cold and cloudy
OL,17,Fovernight with further rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
